utor:node1:listening-sockets","global:after_executor:node1:package-health"]},"overall_summary":"Both material task outcomes are satisfied with direct behavioral evidence. The provider-wide restart protocol is also complete: node1 had a healthy pre-restart state, an acknowledged restart, a changed boot identity corroborated by lifecycle snapshots, and recovered Apache, repository data, installed package, and system state.","limitations":[]}
